        "quiz_id": 10148,
        "type": "writing",
        "title": "In many countries, family members and friends are spending less time looking after elderly relatives. What are the reasons for this? What effects does this have on the elderly and society?",
        "status": "draft",
        "content_writing": "<div data-page-id=\"JuQideLPRoMGEExA9v7lN5ifg4d\" data-lark-html-role=\"root\" data-docx-has-block-data=\"false\">\n<div class=\"ace-line ace-line old-record-id-D5jndiJmDolgYCxRuD0lVbkLgGV\"><em><strong>In many countries, family members and friends </strong></em><em><strong>are spending</strong></em><em><strong> less time looking after elderly relatives. What are the reasons for this? What effects does this have on the elderly and society?</strong></em></div>\n</div>",
        "order": 1,
        "instruction": "<div data-page-id=\"KDygdzHXmoLYnqxeNBSlhbHrg4c\" data-lark-html-role=\"root\" data-docx-has-block-data=\"false\">\n<div class=\"ace-line ace-line old-record-id-NTzNd8mj9oUwbFx0MFilTG8bg97\">\n<h2 style=\"text-align: center;\">HƯỚNG DẪN VIẾT B&Agrave;I</h2>\n<p style=\"text-align: center;\"><em>IELTS Writing Task 2 - Decline in family-based elderly care&nbsp;<span style=\"color: rgb(53, 152, 219);\"><strong><a style=\"color: rgb(53, 152, 219); text-decoration: underline;\" href=\"https://rebrand.ly/essay-structure-logical-framework\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener\">theo Logical Framework<sup>&copy;</sup></a></strong></span></em></p>\n<h3 class=\"ace-line ace-line old-record-id-UQlGdpAaUoJFOsxWOYzlDAiUgDe\" style=\"text-align: justify;\">&nbsp;</h3>\n<h3 class=\"ace-line ace-line old-record-id-UQlGdpAaUoJFOsxWOYzlDAiUgDe\" style=\"text-align: justify;\"><span style=\"color: rgb(240, 95, 35);\"><strong>1.</strong><strong> Hiểu đề &amp; viết Introduction:</strong></span></h3>\n<div style=\"text-align: justify;\" data-page-id=\"Dt2fdKQh8oQDZXxORVzlyE5bgdj\" data-lark-html-role=\"root\" data-docx-has-block-data=\"false\">\n<div data-page-id=\"Dt2fdKQh8oQDZXxORVzlyE5bgdj\" data-lark-html-role=\"root\" data-docx-has-block-data=\"false\">\n<div data-page-id=\"LhvxdlwoRowrFWxCj4llb7Acgje\" data-lark-html-role=\"root\" data-docx-has-block-data=\"false\">\n<ul class=\"list-bullet1\">\n<li class=\"ace-line ace-line old-record-id-Tu0SddWcDoz931xKri8lpq8Wgxh\" data-list=\"bullet\">\n<div><strong>Đề&nbsp;<em>Decline in family-based elderly care </em>cho 1 xu hướng: </strong>Ở nhiều quốc gia, c&aacute;c th&agrave;nh vi&ecirc;n trong gia đ&igrave;nh v&agrave; bạn b&egrave; d&agrave;nh &iacute;t thời gian hơn để chăm s&oacute;c người th&acirc;n lớn tuổi.</div>\n</li>\n<li class=\"ace-line ace-line old-record-id-Ct2UdtYdhoby7Nxrd2SlZFGAgIf\" data-list=\"bullet\">\n<div><strong>Dạng c&acirc;u hỏi:</strong> Trả lời 2 c&acirc;u hỏi trực tiếp: <em>Nguy&ecirc;n nh&acirc;n của hiện tượng n&agrave;y l&agrave; g&igrave;? Điều n&agrave;y g&acirc;y ra những ảnh hưởng g&igrave; đối với người lớn tuổi v&agrave; x&atilde; hội?</em></div>\n</li>\n</ul>\n<div class=\"ace-line ace-line old-record-id-CRaBdsLuZoP0rUxH5FWly8vXgUb\">Dựa v&agrave;o đề b&agrave;i&nbsp;<em>Decline in family-based elderly care</em>&nbsp;v&agrave; c&acirc;u hỏi, ch&uacute;ng ta c&oacute; thể viết được phần Introduction. Theo <strong>Logical Framework<sup>&copy;</sup></strong>, phần Introduction lu&ocirc;n c&oacute; 2 c&acirc;u:</div>\n<ul class=\"list-bullet1\">\n<li class=\"ace-line ace-line old-record-id-RvxLdkWg2o1TemxUMSJlS50eguh\" data-list=\"bullet\">\n<div><strong>C&acirc;u 1: </strong>Paraphrase đề b&agrave;i</div>\n</li>\n<li class=\"ace-line ace-line old-record-id-TS3PdFFE4ooFjlx0jselldGTgEe\" data-list=\"bullet\">\n<div><strong>C&acirc;u 2: </strong>Thesis statement - Trả lời c&acirc;u hỏi</div>\n</li>\n</ul>\n<div class=\"ace-line ace-line old-record-id-O66RdEdiuoAwdBxsDMPlxpn0gCd\"><span style=\"color: rgb(51, 164, 51);\"><strong>Gợi &yacute; Paraphrasing</strong></span></div>\n<ul class=\"list-bullet1\">\n<li class=\"ace-line ace-line old-record-id-RQSlddEvOoG6VVxAXT3lJrsjg38\" data-list=\"bullet\">devote less time to [doing sth] <em>(d&agrave;nh &iacute;t thời gian cho [việc g&igrave; đ&oacute;])</em></li>\n<li class=\"ace-line ace-line old-record-id-RQSlddEvOoG6VVxAXT3lJrsjg38\" data-list=\"bullet\">\n<div data-page-id=\"JuQideLPRoMGEExA9v7lN5ifg4d\" data-lark-html-role=\"root\" data-docx-has-block-data=\"false\">\n<div class=\" old-record-id-Jtb8drkGDoEiG6xpUl0lLa7Tg0g\">the aging population <em>(những người gi&agrave;)</em></div>\n</div>\n</li>\n</ul>\n</div>\n</div>\n<div class=\"ace-line ace-line old-record-id-AUxLdwnbKof5AxxE7qFlhlHMgTg\">\n<div>\n<div data-page-id=\"Dt2fdKQh8oQDZXxORVzlyE5bgdj\" data-lark-html-role=\"root\" data-docx-has-block-data=\"false\">\n<div data-page-id=\"Dt2fdKQh8oQDZXxORVzlyE5bgdj\" data-lark-html-role=\"root\" data-docx-has-block-data=\"false\">&nbsp;</div>\n</div>\n</div>\n</div>\n</div>\n<div class=\"ace-line ace-line old-record-id-TTLqda2f9ooxOTxsgKLlEoHXgHc\" style=\"text-align: justify;\">\n<h3 class=\"ace-line ace-line old-record-id-VqlMdCrpLo9ZDwxoVI4lrX3Qgcg\"><span style=\"color: rgb(240, 95, 35);\"><strong>2.</strong><strong> Gợi &yacute; lập luận &amp; ph&acirc;n BODY:</strong></span></h3>\n<div data-page-id=\"Dt2fdKQh8oQDZXxORVzlyE5bgdj\" data-lark-html-role=\"root\" data-docx-has-block-data=\"false\">\n<div class=\"ace-line ace-line old-record-id-Pklmddy9Bo7tzyxz8N8lq70Dgyb\">\n<div data-page-id=\"Dt2fdKQh8oQDZXxORVzlyE5bgdj\" data-lark-html-role=\"root\" data-docx-has-block-data=\"false\">\n<div class=\"ace-line ace-line old-record-id-FpNbd7IdBoA4Ctx6gxsl4JN5gie\">\n<div data-page-id=\"LhvxdlwoRowrFWxCj4llb7Acgje\" data-lark-html-role=\"root\" data-docx-has-block-data=\"false\">\n<div class=\"ace-line ace-line old-record-id-OWsUdfdiSo5zJSxHBAElqPqPgMf\">\n<div data-page-id=\"LhvxdlwoRowrFWxCj4llb7Acgje\" data-lark-html-role=\"root\" data-docx-has-block-data=\"false\">\n<div class=\"ace-line ace-line old-record-id-DnoWda9NLoogFOxHQgvljDWwgQI\">\n<div data-page-id=\"LhvxdlwoRowrFWxCj4llb7Acgje\" data-lark-html-role=\"root\" data-docx-has-block-data=\"false\">\n<div class=\"ace-line ace-line old-record-id-Y0VTdv3RjoVBMUxyY6glDwkugHc\">\n<div data-page-id=\"LhvxdlwoRowrFWxCj4llb7Acgje\" data-lark-html-role=\"root\" data-docx-has-block-data=\"false\">\n<div class=\"ace-line ace-line old-record-id-Xxw3dzwzloLfvMx31Ozl4U5Rgdd\">\n<div data-page-id=\"LhvxdlwoRowrFWxCj4llb7Acgje\" data-lark-html-role=\"root\" data-docx-has-block-data=\"false\">\n<div class=\"ace-line ace-line old-record-id-GNJ6d5ipHoc8XKxmUm7lK2WGgfe\">\n<div data-page-id=\"LhvxdlwoRowrFWxCj4llb7Acgje\" data-lark-html-role=\"root\" data-docx-has-block-data=\"false\">\n<div class=\"ace-line ace-line old-record-id-IbjJdoy4ooQvOuxYcF4lOk6kgMf\">\n<div data-page-id=\"LhvxdlwoRowrFWxCj4llb7Acgje\" data-lark-html-role=\"root\" data-docx-has-block-data=\"false\">\n<div class=\"ace-line ace-line old-record-id-Sukddc77loPsMxxLtyKlkqdYgFb\">\n<div data-page-id=\"LhvxdlwoRowrFWxCj4llb7Acgje\" data-lark-html-role=\"root\" data-docx-has-block-data=\"false\">\n<div class=\"ace-line ace-line old-record-id-C7yrdcTO5oqFcXxj2eulMHpUgdc\">\n<div data-page-id=\"LhvxdlwoRowrFWxCj4llb7Acgje\" data-lark-html-role=\"root\" data-docx-has-block-data=\"false\">\n<div class=\"ace-line ace-line old-record-id-JsabdjYrpoeNLgx2I7glvIXKgfe\">Theo <strong>Logical Framework<sup>&copy;</sup></strong>, đối với dạng c&oacute; <strong>hai c&acirc;u hỏi độc lập</strong>, th&igrave; ch&uacute;ng m&igrave;nh sẽ lần lượt trả lời từng c&acirc;u hỏi trong mỗi BODY như sau:</div>\n<ul class=\"list-bullet1\">\n<li class=\"ace-line ace-line old-record-id-NHondlQHQoSvFwxo2qRljImZgOe\" data-list=\"bullet\">\n<div><strong>BODY 1:</strong> Tr&igrave;nh b&agrave;y v&agrave; ph&acirc;n t&iacute;ch c&aacute;c nguy&ecirc;n nh&acirc;n v&igrave; sao gia đ&igrave;nh v&agrave; bạn b&egrave; d&agrave;nh &iacute;t thời gian chăm s&oacute;c người gi&agrave; hơn</div>\n</li>\n<li class=\"ace-line ace-line old-record-id-W3xqd9C33ot9ZExvD6el2ifBgnd\" data-list=\"bullet\">\n<div><strong>BODY 2:</strong> Ph&acirc;n t&iacute;ch những hệ quả của xu hướng n&agrave;y đối với người gi&agrave; v&agrave; x&atilde; hội</div>\n</li>\n</ul>\n</div>\n</div>\n</div>\n</div>\n</div>\n</div>\n</div>\n</div>\n</div>\n</div>\n</div>\n</div>\n</div>\n</div>\n</div>\n</div>\n</div>\n</div>\n</div>\n</div>\n</div>\n</div>\n<div class=\"ace-line ace-line old-record-id-HEkZdVl0Loexrnx8bSzlHBRBg3D\" style=\"text-align: justify;\">\n<div class=\"ace-line ace-line old-record-id-CRT6dLvfRoVbHtxCnc9l7AdygTl\">\n<div class=\"ace-line ace-line old-record-id-E6xsduRXyo7PgoxfRdNlJsyWgCb\"><em>(*) Nếu bạn chưa nắm vững về cấu tr&uacute;c đoạn văn v&agrave; logic ph&aacute;t triển &yacute; theo <strong>Logical Framework<sup>&copy;</sup></strong><strong>&nbsp;</strong>th&igrave; bạn h&atilde;y xem c&aacute;c b&agrave;i học sau trước khi viết b&agrave;i theo gợi &yacute; ở bước 3 nh&eacute;:</em></div>\n<div class=\"ace-line ace-line old-record-id-ZCi8dUtrIoNNTTx7gl3llDpYgUL\"><span style=\"color: rgb(53, 152, 219);\"><strong><a style=\"color: rgb(53, 152, 219); text-decoration: underline;\" href=\"https://rebrand.ly/cau-truc-doan-van\" target=\"_self\">Logic sắp xếp th&ocirc;ng tin trong paragraph</a></strong></span></div>\n<div class=\"ace-line ace-line old-record-id-Jvy7dry7XoJRCyx1bgulj2smgZf\"><span style=\"color: rgb(53, 152, 219);\"><strong><a style=\"color: rgb(53, 152, 219); text-decoration: underline;\" href=\"https://rebrand.ly/development-reason-impact\" target=\"_self\">Logic ph&aacute;t triển core idea bằng Reason v&agrave; Impact</a></strong></span></div>\n<div class=\"ace-line ace-line old-record-id-DqjpdMqWWoiZ5lxsEK7lpzBagSh\"><span style=\"color: rgb(53, 152, 219);\"><strong><a style=\"color: rgb(53, 152, 219); text-decoration: underline;\" href=\"https://rebrand.ly/development-example\" target=\"_self\">Logic ph&aacute;t triển core idea bằng Example</a></strong></span></div>\n</div>\n</div>\n<div class=\"ace-line ace-line old-record-id-J4uYdJ7WaomtjrxzeNDl41h0g1n\" style=\"text-align: justify;\">\n<h2 class=\"ace-line ace-line old-record-id-VqlMdCrpLo9ZDwxoVI4lrX3Qgcg\">&nbsp;</h2>\n<h3 class=\"ace-line ace-line old-record-id-VqlMdCrpLo9ZDwxoVI4lrX3Qgcg\"><span style=\"color: rgb(240, 95, 35);\"><strong>3.</strong><strong> Viết BODY 1: Tr&igrave;nh b&agrave;y v&agrave; ph&acirc;n t&iacute;ch c&aacute;c nguy&ecirc;n nh&acirc;n v&igrave; sao gia đ&igrave;nh v&agrave; bạn b&egrave; d&agrave;nh &iacute;t thời gian chăm s&oacute;c người gi&agrave; hơn</strong></span></h3>\n</div>\n<div class=\"ace-line ace-line old-record-id-Kk5gd8w6foneJkxtmd7ld1C4grP\" style=\"text-align: justify;\">\n<div data-page-id=\"YP3XdinBZozo9Qx3V4elcqv1gBd\" data-lark-html-role=\"root\" data-docx-has-block-data=\"false\">\n<div class=\"ace-line ace-line old-record-id-OTuvdKP8xofWPhxe3dnljyPXgvd\">\n<div data-page-id=\"Dt2fdKQh8oQDZXxORVzlyE5bgdj\" data-lark-html-role=\"root\" data-docx-has-block-data=\"false\">\n<div data-page-id=\"Dt2fdKQh8oQDZXxORVzlyE5bgdj\" data-lark-html-role=\"root\" data-docx-has-block-data=\"false\">\n<div class=\"ace-line ace-line old-record-id-GGx2dtMsVo2SRMxTaHOlDGY0gIh\">\n<div data-page-id=\"LhvxdlwoRowrFWxCj4llb7Acgje\" data-lark-html-role=\"root\" data-docx-has-block-data=\"false\">\n<div class=\"ace-line ace-line old-record-id-OUsndgv96oXwDFxW1FrloHVrgAe\">\n<div data-page-id=\"LhvxdlwoRowrFWxCj4llb7Acgje\" data-lark-html-role=\"root\" data-docx-has-block-data=\"false\">\n<div class=\"ace-line ace-line old-record-id-GRTBdEWugofGoixOPJblvMOygNU\">\n<div data-page-id=\"LhvxdlwoRowrFWxCj4llb7Acgje\" data-lark-html-role=\"root\" data-docx-has-block-data=\"false\">\n<div class=\"ace-line ace-line old-record-id-CqPEd28cco0ycmxZHuQlljkHgMe\">\n<div data-page-id=\"LhvxdlwoRowrFWxCj4llb7Acgje\" data-lark-html-role=\"root\" data-docx-has-block-data=\"false\">\n<div class=\"ace-line ace-line old-record-id-T4nldWXyRoUmvgxl7nOldzdAgIf\">\n<div data-page-id=\"LhvxdlwoRowrFWxCj4llb7Acgje\" data-lark-html-role=\"root\" data-docx-has-block-data=\"false\">\n<div class=\"ace-line ace-line old-record-id-CizadgB9moHAc1xIKRIlK0EVgAz\">\n<div data-page-id=\"LhvxdlwoRowrFWxCj4llb7Acgje\" data-lark-html-role=\"root\" data-docx-has-block-data=\"false\">\n<div class=\"ace-line ace-line old-record-id-TYRIdhFgWoNmKuxEEpklKyzbgMh\">\n<div data-page-id=\"LhvxdlwoRowrFWxCj4llb7Acgje\" data-lark-html-role=\"root\" data-docx-has-block-data=\"false\">\n<div class=\"ace-line ace-line old-record-id-RoD7dJ6YFoa0rLxlxj1l11v0gwo\">\n<div data-page-id=\"LhvxdlwoRowrFWxCj4llb7Acgje\" data-lark-html-role=\"root\" data-docx-has-block-data=\"false\">\n<div class=\"ace-line ace-line old-record-id-F5tQdQOeaoe8mMxQ5UklAxSJgNh\">\n<div data-page-id=\"LhvxdlwoRowrFWxCj4llb7Acgje\" data-lark-html-role=\"root\" data-docx-has-block-data=\"false\">\n<div class=\"ace-line ace-line old-record-id-WhKydTGIuoxZ05xYIxWlZPqbgTh\"><span style=\"color: rgb(51, 164, 51);\"><strong>Topic sentence: </strong></span>C&oacute; hai nguy&ecirc;n nh&acirc;n ch&iacute;nh dẫn đến xu hướng n&agrave;y, li&ecirc;n quan đến <em>khoảng c&aacute;ch địa l&yacute; (geographical distance) </em>v&agrave; <em>lối sống bận rộn (demanding lifestyles)</em></div>\n<div class=\"ace-line ace-line old-record-id-WhKydTGIuoxZ05xYIxWlZPqbgTh\">&nbsp;</div>\n<div class=\"ace-line ace-line old-record-id-B7iId6hhwoyuHZxjXJ5l19sfgKd\"><span style=\"color: rgb(51, 164, 51);\"><strong>Supporting idea 1:</strong></span></div>\n<ul class=\"list-bullet1\">\n<li class=\"ace-line ace-line old-record-id-JAgHdsdjDohJbvxNORLlgQBqg7c\" data-list=\"bullet\">\n<div><strong>Core Idea:</strong> L&iacute; do lớn nhất l&agrave; do giới&nbsp;trẻ c&oacute; xu hướng <em>chuyển đến c&aacute;c khu vực đ&ocirc; thị</em> <em>để t&igrave;m kiếm cơ hội việc l&agrave;m tốt hơn (relocate to urban areas in search of better career opportunities)</em></div>\n</li>\n<li class=\"ace-line ace-line old-record-id-ZexDdV8ppoE82kxisQPlQ71Ag0e\" data-list=\"bullet\">\n<div><strong>Reason + Impact:&nbsp;</strong>Khi <em>thị trường lao động (job market)</em> ng&agrave;y c&agrave;ng trở n&ecirc;n cạnh tranh, nhiều người hầu như kh&ocirc;ng c&ograve;n lựa chọn n&agrave;o kh&aacute;c ngo&agrave;i việc chuyển đến c&aacute;c th&agrave;nh phố lớn, vốn thường c&aacute;ch xa qu&ecirc; hương, nơi cha mẹ gi&agrave; của họ đang sinh sống. Khoảng c&aacute;ch địa l&yacute; n&agrave;y khiến họ rất kh&oacute; c&oacute; thể thường xuy&ecirc;n về thăm hoặc <em>chăm s&oacute;c c&aacute;c nhu cầu của những th&agrave;nh vi&ecirc;n lớn tuổi trong gia đ&igrave;nh thường xuy&ecirc;n (attend to the needs of their aging family members on a regular basis)</em></div>\n</li>\n</ul>\n<div class=\"ace-line ace-line old-record-id-XrwCd0yJMo0jNUxFNvNlWLcfg1e\"><span style=\"color: rgb(51, 164, 51);\"><strong>Supporting idea 2: </strong></span></div>\n<ul class=\"list-bullet1\">\n<li class=\"ace-line ace-line old-record-id-Vs9bdaafkoRCYVxqvhOlBBh7gLe\" data-list=\"bullet\">\n<div><strong>Core Idea:</strong> Hơn nữa, ngay cả những người sống gần cha mẹ <em>cũng thường bận rộn với lịch l&agrave;m việc d&agrave;y đặc (are often occupied with demanding work schedules)</em></div>\n</li>\n<li class=\"ace-line ace-line old-record-id-BZXVdOwYboLow7xjqDRlYMmVgBc\" data-list=\"bullet\">\n<div><strong>Reason + Impact:&nbsp;</strong><em>Khi thời gian l&agrave;m việc k&eacute;o d&agrave;i dần trở th&agrave;nh điều b&igrave;nh thường trong x&atilde; hội hiện đại (With longer working hours becoming the norm in modern society)</em>, nhiều người c&ograve;n kh&ocirc;ng đủ thời gian cho bản th&acirc;n, <em>huống chi l&agrave; chăm s&oacute;c người th&acirc;n cao tuổi (let alone looking after their elderly relatives)</em>. Hậu quả l&agrave; tr&aacute;ch nhiệm phụng dưỡng người gi&agrave; <em>đang dần bị xem nhẹ (is gradually being neglected)</em></div>\n</li>\n</ul>\n</div>\n</div>\n</div>\n</div>\n</div>\n</div>\n</div>\n</div>\n</div>\n</div>\n</div>\n</div>\n</div>\n</div>\n</div>\n</div>\n</div>\n</div>\n</div>\n</div>\n</div>\n</div>\n</div>\n<div class=\"ace-line ace-line old-record-id-M2Q9ds2Mgoz0ICx8JzslKUMJgWf\" style=\"text-align: justify;\">&nbsp;</div>\n<div class=\"ace-line ace-line old-record-id-M2Q9ds2Mgoz0ICx8JzslKUMJgWf\" style=\"text-align: justify;\">\n<h3 class=\"ace-line ace-line old-record-id-VqlMdCrpLo9ZDwxoVI4lrX3Qgcg\"><span style=\"color: rgb(240, 95, 35);\"><strong>4.</strong><strong> Viết BODY 2: </strong>Ph&acirc;n t&iacute;ch những hệ quả của xu hướng n&agrave;y đối với người gi&agrave; v&agrave; x&atilde; hội</span></h3>\n<div data-page-id=\"Dt2fdKQh8oQDZXxORVzlyE5bgdj\" data-lark-html-role=\"root\" data-docx-has-block-data=\"false\">\n<div data-page-id=\"Dt2fdKQh8oQDZXxORVzlyE5bgdj\" data-lark-html-role=\"root\" data-docx-has-block-data=\"false\">\n<div class=\"ace-line ace-line old-record-id-KrtVdtupRoKL6sxjDB2lsqewgkf\">\n<div data-page-id=\"LhvxdlwoRowrFWxCj4llb7Acgje\" data-lark-html-role=\"root\" data-docx-has-block-data=\"false\">\n<div class=\"ace-line ace-line old-record-id-IpmcdM2KVo20yvx1AcclbEoFgNe\">\n<div data-page-id=\"LhvxdlwoRowrFWxCj4llb7Acgje\" data-lark-html-role=\"root\" data-docx-has-block-data=\"false\">\n<div class=\"ace-line ace-line old-record-id-WdeNdWsDkoHkxfxFq99lekOpgte\">\n<div data-page-id=\"LhvxdlwoRowrFWxCj4llb7Acgje\" data-lark-html-role=\"root\" data-docx-has-block-data=\"false\">\n<div class=\"ace-line ace-line old-record-id-Zq8Ed5ZPxoJixmxjWwPlsAd9gQ8\">\n<div data-page-id=\"LhvxdlwoRowrFWxCj4llb7Acgje\" data-lark-html-role=\"root\" data-docx-has-block-data=\"false\">\n<div class=\"ace-line ace-line old-record-id-Q9QVdRGxLozW5JxLNrOlZt4TgTh\">\n<div data-page-id=\"LhvxdlwoRowrFWxCj4llb7Acgje\" data-lark-html-role=\"root\" data-docx-has-block-data=\"false\">\n<div class=\"ace-line ace-line old-record-id-Ec7GdL8hOopk25xWQG2llrpWgfd\">\n<div data-page-id=\"LhvxdlwoRowrFWxCj4llb7Acgje\" data-lark-html-role=\"root\" data-docx-has-block-data=\"false\">\n<div class=\"ace-line ace-line old-record-id-S88bdXvGSorowHxwaxulSLSbgsh\">\n<div data-page-id=\"LhvxdlwoRowrFWxCj4llb7Acgje\" data-lark-html-role=\"root\" data-docx-has-block-data=\"false\">\n<div class=\"ace-line ace-line old-record-id-CjagdHbLyoowjwxYEW4l2Quigug\">\n<div data-page-id=\"LhvxdlwoRowrFWxCj4llb7Acgje\" data-lark-html-role=\"root\" data-docx-has-block-data=\"false\">\n<div class=\"ace-line ace-line old-record-id-CjagdHbLyoowjwxYEW4l2Quigug\">\n<div data-page-id=\"LhvxdlwoRowrFWxCj4llb7Acgje\" data-lark-html-role=\"root\" data-docx-has-block-data=\"false\">\n<div class=\"ace-line ace-line old-record-id-IMDNd3MH4oKzDpxutSSl4mMegvh\">\n<div data-page-id=\"LhvxdlwoRowrFWxCj4llb7Acgje\" data-lark-html-role=\"root\" data-docx-has-block-data=\"false\">\n<div class=\"ace-line ace-line old-record-id-Sw7Nd7yYpoSL3kxZzWXl77tKgdX\"><span style=\"color: rgb(51, 164, 51);\"><strong>Topic sentence: </strong></span>Tuy nhi&ecirc;n, xu hướng n&agrave;y c&oacute; thể dẫn đến nhiều hệ quả ti&ecirc;u cực.</div>\n<div class=\"ace-line ace-line old-record-id-Sw7Nd7yYpoSL3kxZzWXl77tKgdX\">&nbsp;</div>\n<div class=\"ace-line ace-line old-record-id-PhRSdel6LoOHtWxhOaHllMpKg9d\"><span style=\"color: rgb(51, 164, 51);\"><strong>Supporting idea 1:</strong></span></div>\n<ul class=\"list-bullet1\">\n<li class=\"ace-line ace-line old-record-id-I0XddwQJBoLl6YxsgWvlneqvgue\" data-list=\"bullet\">\n<div><strong>Core Idea:</strong> Trước hết, người cao tuổi <em>khi kh&ocirc;ng li&ecirc;n lạc thường xuy&ecirc;n với gia đ&igrave;nh (lack regular contact with their families)</em> rất dễ <em>rơi v&agrave;o cảm gi&aacute;c c&ocirc; đơn v&agrave; trầm cảm (experience feelings of loneliness and depression)</em></div>\n</li>\n<li class=\"ace-line ace-line old-record-id-T7izdK6wjo64yOxA6F6lS0Y6gLb\" data-list=\"bullet\">\n<div><strong>Reason + Impact:&nbsp;</strong><em>Sự c&ocirc; lập n&agrave;y (This sense of isolation) </em>từ đ&oacute; c&oacute; thể<em> ảnh hưởng nghi&ecirc;m trọng đến cả sức khỏe tinh thần lẫn thể chất của họ (take a serious toll on both their mental and physical well-being)</em>, bởi thường kh&ocirc;ng c&oacute; ai b&ecirc;n cạnh để kịp thời nhận ra những <em>dấu hiệu bệnh tật ban đầu (early signs of illness)</em> hoặc <em>chăm s&oacute;c khi cần thiết (provide timely care when needed)</em></div>\n</li>\n</ul>\n<div class=\"ace-line ace-line old-record-id-OKdBd2jDColbB2xUgeJl0rQMgNe\"><span style=\"color: rgb(51, 164, 51);\"><strong>Supporting idea 2:</strong></span></div>\n<ul class=\"list-bullet1\">\n<li class=\"ace-line ace-line old-record-id-RzLPd2a0toBjxZx1fA6luq2ngfd\" data-list=\"bullet\">\n<div><strong>Core Idea:&nbsp;</strong>B&ecirc;n cạnh t&aacute;c động đối với ch&iacute;nh người cao tuổi, xu hướng n&agrave;y c&ograve;n <em>tạo ra g&aacute;nh nặng đ&aacute;ng kể cho ch&iacute;nh phủ (places a considerable burden on the government)</em></div>\n</li>\n<li class=\"ace-line ace-line old-record-id-RzLPd2a0toBjxZx1fA6luq2ngfd\" data-list=\"bullet\">\n<div><strong>Reason + Impact:&nbsp;</strong>Khi ng&agrave;y c&agrave;ng &iacute;t gia đ&igrave;nh c&oacute; thể tự chăm s&oacute;c c&aacute;c th&agrave;nh vi&ecirc;n lớn tuổi, nh&agrave; nước buộc phải <em>ph&acirc;n bổ th&ecirc;m ng&acirc;n s&aacute;ch cho c&aacute;c viện dưỡng l&atilde;o c&ocirc;ng lập v&agrave; dịch vụ y tế (allocate more funding to public nursing homes and healthcare services).</em> Hệ quả l&agrave; <em>nguồn lực c&oacute; thể bị chuyển hướng khỏi những lĩnh vực thiết yếu kh&aacute;c (divert resources from other essential sectors)</em> như gi&aacute;o dục hoặc ph&aacute;t triển cơ sở hạ tầng, từ đ&oacute; <em>cản trở sự ph&aacute;t triển chung của đất nước về l&acirc;u d&agrave;i (hinder the overall progress of the country in the long run)</em></div>\n</li>\n</ul>\n</div>\n</div>\n</div>\n</div>\n</div>\n</div>\n</div>\n</div>\n</div>\n</div>\n</div>\n</div>\n</div>\n</div>\n</div>\n</div>\n</div>\n</div>\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\n</div>\n</div>\n</div>\n</div>\n</div>\n<div class=\"ace-line ace-line old-record-id-RIbUdfSlNoloclxlVrOltQUhg8e\" style=\"text-align: justify;\">\n<h3 class=\"ace-line ace-line old-record-id-VqlMdCrpLo9ZDwxoVI4lrX3Qgcg\"><span style=\"color: rgb(240, 95, 35);\"><strong>5.</strong><strong> Viết Conclusion:</strong></span></h3>\n</div>\n<div class=\"ace-line ace-line old-record-id-QkOnd9VeToRuWPxTqkUlIuw9gif\">\n<div data-page-id=\"YP3XdinBZozo9Qx3V4elcqv1gBd\" data-lark-html-role=\"root\" data-docx-has-block-data=\"false\">\n<div class=\"ace-line ace-line old-record-id-MGPwd7mnhojSSExL2sIl4MDVgae\">\n<div data-page-id=\"YP3XdinBZozo9Qx3V4elcqv1gBd\" data-lark-html-role=\"root\" data-docx-has-block-data=\"false\">\n<div class=\"ace-line ace-line old-record-id-MGPwd7mnhojSSExL2sIl4MDVgae\">\n<div data-page-id=\"Dt2fdKQh8oQDZXxORVzlyE5bgdj\" data-lark-html-role=\"root\" data-docx-has-block-data=\"false\">\n<div data-page-id=\"Dt2fdKQh8oQDZXxORVzlyE5bgdj\" data-lark-html-role=\"root\" data-docx-has-block-data=\"false\">\n<div class=\"ace-line ace-line old-record-id-Jx3IdxsyToocMyxrcHBlR5M4gTb\">\n<div data-page-id=\"Dt2fdKQh8oQDZXxORVzlyE5bgdj\" data-lark-html-role=\"root\" data-docx-has-block-data=\"false\">\n<div class=\"ace-line ace-line old-record-id-Z215dilK9oetfOxPDFol02JKgkg\">\n<div data-page-id=\"LhvxdlwoRowrFWxCj4llb7Acgje\" data-lark-html-role=\"root\" data-docx-has-block-data=\"false\">\n<div class=\"ace-line ace-line old-record-id-JRbGdLxfwoyo3LxfaWvlKYZxgLh\">\n<div data-page-id=\"LhvxdlwoRowrFWxCj4llb7Acgje\" data-lark-html-role=\"root\" data-docx-has-block-data=\"false\">\n<div class=\"ace-line ace-line old-record-id-S41gdx1Yho0RQhxH1Zclco4KgPH\">\n<div data-page-id=\"LhvxdlwoRowrFWxCj4llb7Acgje\" data-lark-html-role=\"root\" data-docx-has-block-data=\"false\">\n<div class=\"ace-line ace-line old-record-id-MDkodyWDGo2nbTx3llNlDkiTgye\">\n<div data-page-id=\"LhvxdlwoRowrFWxCj4llb7Acgje\" data-lark-html-role=\"root\" data-docx-has-block-data=\"false\">\n<div class=\"ace-line ace-line old-record-id-Bx6adWi8AoLDF0xo9FAl8FSSgig\">\n<div data-page-id=\"LhvxdlwoRowrFWxCj4llb7Acgje\" data-lark-html-role=\"root\" data-docx-has-block-data=\"false\">\n<div class=\"ace-line ace-line old-record-id-Y8TJdaqR0oT0n0xPP4JlvEIWg8e\">\n<div data-page-id=\"LhvxdlwoRowrFWxCj4llb7Acgje\" data-lark-html-role=\"root\" data-docx-has-block-data=\"false\">\n<div class=\"ace-line ace-line old-record-id-QOh0dpvFwodYoYxAfXPlC5RmgbG\">\n<div data-page-id=\"LhvxdlwoRowrFWxCj4llb7Acgje\" data-lark-html-role=\"root\" data-docx-has-block-data=\"false\">\n<div class=\"ace-line ace-line old-record-id-YUnRdmwHoomd0bx3B9xl3s1Agte\">\n<div data-page-id=\"LhvxdlwoRowrFWxCj4llb7Acgje\" data-lark-html-role=\"root\" data-docx-has-block-data=\"false\">\n<div class=\"ace-line ace-line old-record-id-YvCFdQxWsoceFLxYDv4lsxKqg2d\" style=\"text-align: justify;\">Bạn h&atilde;y viết Conclusion bằng c&aacute;ch <strong>t&oacute;m tắt lại ngắn gọn c&aacute;c &yacute; đ&atilde; được thảo luận trong 2 đoạn BODY nh&eacute;.</strong></div>\n<div class=\"ace-line ace-line old-record-id-YvCFdQxWsoceFLxYDv4lsxKqg2d\" style=\"text-align: justify;\">&nbsp;</div>\n<div class=\"ace-line ace-line old-record-id-X2nCdFhyUoQul9xqlgXlr4PKgvb\" style=\"text-align: justify;\"><span style=\"color: rgb(51, 164, 51);\"><strong>Gợi &yacute; Paraphrasing</strong></span></div>\n<ul class=\"list-bullet1\">\n<li class=\"ace-line ace-line old-record-id-Ee4Jdw1TOosZpRxGDvJlAJHVgyb\" style=\"text-align: justify;\" data-list=\"bullet\">family-based elderly care <em>(chăm s&oacute;c người lớn tuổi trong gia đ&igrave;nh)</em></li>\n<li class=\"ace-line ace-line old-record-id-Ee4Jdw1TOosZpRxGDvJlAJHVgyb\" style=\"text-align: justify;\" data-list=\"bullet\">geographical separation <em>(r&agrave;o cản địa l&yacute;)</em></li>\n<li class=\"ace-line ace-line old-record-id-Ee4Jdw1TOosZpRxGDvJlAJHVgyb\" style=\"text-align: justify;\" data-list=\"bullet\">poses serious risks to the health and happiness of older people&nbsp;<em>(đe dọa đến sức khỏe v&agrave; tinh thần của người cao tuổi)</em></li>\n<li class=\"ace-line ace-line old-record-id-Ee4Jdw1TOosZpRxGDvJlAJHVgyb\" style=\"text-align: justify;\" data-list=\"bullet\">puts additional financial strain on governments&nbsp;<em>(g&acirc;y &aacute;p lực t&agrave;i ch&iacute;nh l&ecirc;n ch&iacute;nh phủ)</em></li>\n</ul>\n</div>\n</div>\n</div>\n</div>\n</div>\n</div>\n</div>\n</div>\n</div>\n</div>\n</div>\n</div>\n</div>\n</div>\n</div>\n</div>\n</div>\n</div>\n</div>\n</div>\n</div>\n</div>\n</div>\n</div>\n</div>\n</div>\n</div>",
        "writing_logical_frame": [
          {
            "id": 3458,
            "sort": 1,
            "name": "Introduction",
            "value": "<p>In many countries, it has become increasingly common for family members and friends to devote less time to caring for their elderly relatives. This trend can be attributed to several factors, and it has significant consequences for both the aging population and society as a whole.</p>",
            "question_id": 43847,
            "is_toggle_on": true
          },
          {
            "id": 3459,
            "sort": 2,
            "name": "Body 1",
            "value": "<p><strong>There are two main reasons behind this trend, relating to geographical distance and demanding lifestyles.</strong> <span style=\"color: rgb(45, 194, 107);\">First and foremost, young people tend to relocate to urban areas in search of better career opportunities. As the job market becomes more competitive, many individuals have no choice but to move to big cities, which are often far from their hometowns where their elderly parents reside. This geographical distance makes it extremely difficult for them to visit or attend to the needs of their aging family members on a regular basis.</span> <span style=\"color: rgb(53, 152, 219);\">Furthermore, even those who live nearby are often occupied with demanding work schedules. With longer working hours becoming the norm in modern society, people barely have enough time for themselves, let alone looking after their elderly relatives. As a result, the responsibility of caring for the old is gradually being neglected.</span></p>",
            "question_id": 43847,
            "is_toggle_on": true
          },
          {
            "id": 3460,
            "sort": 3,
            "name": "Body 2",
            "value": "<p><strong>This tendency, however, can lead to several detrimental effects. </strong><span style=\"color: rgb(45, 194, 107);\">First and foremost, elderly people who lack regular contact with their families are likely to experience feelings of loneliness and depression. This sense of isolation can, in turn, take a serious toll on both their mental and physical well-being, as there is often no one around to notice early signs of illness or provide timely care when needed.</span> <span style=\"color: rgb(53, 152, 219);\">In addition to the impact on the elderly themselves, this trend also places a considerable burden on the government. As fewer families are able to care for their aging members, the state is forced to allocate more funding to public nursing homes and healthcare services. Consequently, this could divert resources from other essential sectors such as education or infrastructure development, which would hinder the overall progress of the country in the long run.</span></p>",
            "question_id": 43847,
            "is_toggle_on": true
          },
          {
            "id": 3461,
            "sort": 4,
            "name": "Conclusion",
            "value": "<p>In conclusion, the decline in family-based elderly care is largely driven by geographical separation and increasingly busy lifestyles. This shift not only poses serious risks to the health and happiness of older people but also puts additional financial strain on governments.</p>",
            "question_id": 43847,
            "is_toggle_on": true
          }
